    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "The villain is the memory wall. Your hardware acts like a runner stopping dead to wait for the baton, instead of sprinting through the handoff.",
      "visual_focus": "Animation of a relay runner freezing in place while the baton floats slowly toward them.",
      "highlight_words": {
