    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "It leverages wmma load and mma sync primitives, forcing the chip to crunch current blocks while fetching the next one simultaneously.",
      "visual_focus": "Close-up of GPU register files filling up while the compute unit processes the previous block.",
      "highlight_words": {
